type: text/vnd.tiddlywiki

One value from the vocabulary in `list`, in display order.

The values are also gathered into named groups, shown as headings above the values they hold: `groups` lists the group slugs in display order, `group-<slug>` the values of one group. A value named in no group — `hub`, `project` and `tool` here — comes on its own, before the first group. Grouping is display only: group names are translated as `Vocab/role/Group/<slug>` (plus an optional `…/Hint`), and the field still holds the bare value.

Each role also has a plural (`Vocab/role/<slug>/Plural`), used in sentences that name the tiddlers of a role ("tasks do not use this field"): a new role needs one in each language.
